{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41577","headline":"塞下三首 一 · 沈彬","name":"塞下三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞叶声悲秋欲霜，寒山数点下牛羊。\n映霞旅鴈随疎雨，向碛行人带夕阳。\n边骑不来沙路失，国恩深後海城荒。\n胡儿向化新成长，犹自千回问汉王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}